.TH "SCCFM-CLI SCHEMA EXPORT" "1" "2026-06-19" "0.38.0" "sccfm-cli schema export Manual"
.SH NAME
sccfm-cli\-schema\-export \- Export the sccfm-cli command schema.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sccfm-cli schema export
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export the sccfm-cli command schema.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fP [json]
Schema output format.  [default: json]
.TP
\fB\-o,\fP \-\-output FILE
Write schema JSON to a file instead of stdout.
